# Verification run output is local evidence, not source. The two files that
# resolve state - signoff.md for MANUAL criteria, reproductions.md for the
# reproduced/fixed ledger - live directly in run/ and are tracked, because
# they must survive a fresh clone. The per-run directories are not.
delta/changes/*/run/*/

# Generated from the (gitignored) run/ directories above by delta/bin/report.
# Local history, regenerated on demand - not source.
delta/report.html
